{"meta": {"limit": 100, "next": null, "offset": 0, "previous": null, "total_count": 51}, "objects": [{"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-03-24T08:21:29Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 342067, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/342067/", "rev": "03", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-09-21T08:21:29Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2023-09-26T15:53:58Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 336221, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/336221/", "rev": "02", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-07-11T16:51:01Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-03-24T08:21:29Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 358249, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/358249/", "rev": "03", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/2/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-03-24T07:05:00Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-12-28T17:24:34Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 365348, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/365348/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-07-13T17:38:08Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-12-28T17:24:34Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 363906, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/363906/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-06-26T17:24:34Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document makes several prescriptions regarding the following key\r\n   exchange methods in TLS, most of which have been superseded by better\r\n   options:\r\n\r\n1. This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange in TLS.\r\n\r\n2. It limits the use of Diffie Hellman key exchange over a finite field to avoid\r\nknown vulnerabilities and improper security properties.\r\n\r\n3. It discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\r\n\r\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2022-12-17T15:38:02Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 309087, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/309087/", "rev": "00", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-06-15T14:38:02Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document makes several prescriptions regarding the following key\r\n   exchange methods in TLS, most of which have been superseded by better\r\n   options:\r\n\r\n1. This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange in TLS.\r\n\r\n2. It limits the use of Diffie Hellman key exchange over a finite field to avoid\r\nknown vulnerabilities and improper security properties.\r\n\r\n3. It discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\r\n\r\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2022-12-17T15:38:02Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 309180, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/309180/", "rev": "00", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-06-16T17:29:08Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-03-24T08:21:29Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 363647, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/363647/", "rev": "03", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/2/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-06-21T21:08:34Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-03-24T08:21:29Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 363648, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/363648/", "rev": "03", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/2/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-06-21T21:08:37Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document makes several prescriptions regarding the following key\n   exchange methods in TLS, most of which have been superseded by better\n   options:\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2023-06-14T16:35:23Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 321878, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/321878/", "rev": "01", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2022-12-11T16:35:23Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2023-09-26T15:53:58Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 328122, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "", "pages": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/328122/", "rev": "02", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": null, "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2023-03-25T15:53:58Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-12-28T17:24:34Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 365349, "intended_std_level": null, "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/365349/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-07-13T17:38:12Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-12-28T17:24:34Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 365350, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/365350/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-07-13T17:47:21Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by [RFC8996] and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2024-12-28T17:24:34Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 365351, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/365351/", "rev": "04", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-07-13T17:47:14Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 370704, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/370704/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/rev-wg/"], "time": "2024-09-03T09:11:39Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": null, "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 371334, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/371334/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "/api/v1/doc/state/43/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-09-10T17:26:55Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 371335, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/371335/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/16/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2024-09-10T17:27:07Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 371527, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/371527/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/13/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/extpty/"], "time": "2024-09-14T18:07:23Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 390159, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/390159/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/13/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-04-14T17:31:10Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 390160, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/390160/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/14/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-04-14T17:31:45Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 390166, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/390166/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/111/", "/api/v1/doc/state/15/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-04-14T19:11:55Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 391027, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/391027/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "/api/v1/doc/state/15/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-04-25T01:41:35Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This document deprecates the use of RSA key exchange and Diffie\n   Hellman over a finite field in TLS 1.2, and discourages the use of\n   static elliptic curve Diffie Hellman cipher suites.\n\n   Note that these prescriptions apply only to TLS 1.2 since TLS 1.0 and\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-03-07T09:11:39Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 391237, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/391237/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "/api/v1/doc/state/20/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-04-29T18:08:55Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-12-25T16:10:18Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 394212, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/394212/", "rev": "06", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/115/", "/api/v1/doc/state/20/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-06-23T16:10:18Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in (D)TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-12-25T16:10:18Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 394228, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/394228/", "rev": "06", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/115/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-06-23T20:14:29Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in (D)TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-12-25T16:10:18Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 395018, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/395018/", "rev": "06", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2025-07-04T01:44:25Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in (D)TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2025-12-25T16:10:18Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 395907, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/395907/", "rev": "06", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/need-rev/"], "time": "2025-07-10T15:08:07Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in (D)TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905, to\n   deprecate or discourage - i.e., change to MUST NOT or SHOULD NOT, as\n   listed in Section 5.3 Section 5.2 Section 5.3 Section 5.4 Section 5.5\n   - the use of cipher suites using the above key exchange methods in\n   (D)TLS 1.2 connections.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2026-05-17T17:18:54Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 408511, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/408511/", "rev": "07", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/115/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": ["/api/v1/name/doctagname/ad-f-up/"], "time": "2025-11-13T17:18:54Z", "title": "Deprecating Obsolete Key Exchange Methods in (D)TLS 1.2", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   For (D)TLS 1.2, this document deprecates the use of two key\n   exchanges, namely Diffie-Hellman over a finite field and RSA, and it\n   discourages the use of static elliptic curve Diffie-Hellman cipher\n   suites.\n\n   These prescriptions apply only to (D)TLS 1.2 since (D)TLS 1.0 and TLS\n   1.1 are deprecated by RFC 8996 and (D)TLS 1.3 either does not use the\n   affected algorithm or does not share the relevant configuration\n   options.  (There is no DTLS version 1.1.)\n\n   This document updates RFCs 9325, 4346, 5246, 4162, 6347, 5932, 5288,\n   6209, 6367, 8422, 5289, 5469, 4785, 4279, 5487, 6655, and 7905, to\n   deprecate or discourage - i.e., change to MUST NOT or SHOULD NOT, as\n   listed in Section 5.3 Section 5.2 Section 5.3 Section 5.4 Section 5.5\n   - the use of cipher suites using the above key exchange methods in\n   (D)TLS 1.2 connections.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/112723/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex/", "expires": "2026-05-17T17:18:54Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 408630, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/ps/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-deprecate-obsolete-kex", "note": "", "notify": "joe@salowey.net", "pages": 23, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/408630/", "rev": "07", "rfc_number":